    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so it's basically a chain reaction. it's just nerve-wracking how it can feel so... malicious? like, you just touch it wrong and it reacts immediately. is there any way to predict how aggressive the fire will be once it starts, or is it just totally out of control once that cell is breached?",
